  (text "1. Board-to-board socket and 3.3 V buck" (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 0a983707-cfdf-4834-ab5b-a1cd95c02d38))
  (text "TLV62569: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 453k/100k) = 3.32 V. PFM at light load keeps standby low." (at 15.24 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3d8d4410-d3af-449e-b24d-b9cf6ae9fc5c))
  (text "2. ESP32-C6-MINI-1-H4" (at 15.24 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 5d869e47-9b19-4ae5-b090-75c2907075ac))
  (text "Antenna at the faceplate rim, outside the steel box; keep-out per Espressif. Strapping: IO9 pulled up (SPI boot), IO8 pulled up.\nADC1: IO0 = NTC1, IO1 = NTC2. UART1: IO20 RX / IO21 TX to the BL0939. LEDC: IO18/IO19 relays. RMT: IO8 light lines." (at 15.24 77.47 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9b836bbc-869e-4d54-8f3c-af4da8bb5d3f))
  (text "3. Programming and test pads" (at 15.24 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid df6e10ed-7bd1-4e2a-9d1f-ccedb3d1109d))
  (text "USB-Serial-JTAG on IO12/IO13 for flashing and logs; UART0 as fallback. Hold BOOT low at reset for download mode." (at 15.24 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f0576cba-a7c4-4561-a67a-d0ed86ca2811))
